# Label search: nz means "net zero" here, not New Zealand (see documents.sr).
# DevVespaLabelSearchEngine passes rules.rulebase=labels.
# Reference: https://docs.vespa.ai/en/linguistics/query-rewriting.html
# TODO: do we want this to inherit from documents.sr?  nz +> ?"net zero" exists there which affects this rule
@language(en)
@include(documents)
nz -> net zero;
